sm_120 attention patch for karpathy/autoresearch (RLTL;DR autoresearch baseline).

The kernels-hub FA3 builds contain only sm_80/sm_90a code and abort on sm_120 (RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell, RTX 50xx).
Hopper keeps FA3; every other GPU uses FlexAttention for the sliding-window layers and SDPA for the full-causal
layers, with FA3's window semantics (key j visible to query i iff 0 <= i-j <= w), so WINDOW_PATTERN keeps its
meaning. Block masks are built before torch.compile. program.md gets a one-line GPU note (superseded by
patches/harness_program.md). Written by us against upstream commit 228791f; apply in the autoresearch checkout:

  git apply /path/to/patches/sm120_attention.patch

